
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="Cache-Control" content="no-cache, no-store, must-revalidate">
    <meta http-equiv="Pragma" content="no-cache">
    <meta http-equiv="Expires" content="0">

    <title>CapCentral | Admin Dashboard</title>

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --primary: #172554;
            --primary-light: #e8edff;
            --background: #f4f6fb;
            --white: #ffffff;
            --text: #1e293b;
            --muted: #64748b;
            --border: #e2e8f0;
            --success: #15803d;
            --shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: var(--background);
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .layout {
            display: flex;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .sidebar {
            width: 245px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
            padding: 28px 18px;
        }

        .brand {
            font-size: 23px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 0 0 8px;
        }

        .sidebar-subtitle {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .nav-label {
            color: #9ca3af;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin: 24px 10px 10px;
        }

        .sidebar a {
            display: block;
            color: #e5e7eb;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .sidebar a:hover,
        .sidebar a.active {
            background: #263449;
            color: white;
        }

        .main {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 0;
        }

        .topbar {
            background: var(--white);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            padding: 20px 30px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .topbar h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
        }

        .admin-info {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            text-align: right;
        }

        .admin-info strong {
            color: var(--text);
        }

        .content {
            padding: 30px;
            max-width: 1500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .welcome {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .welcome h2 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 25px;
        }

        .welcome p {
            color: var(--muted);
            margin: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 17px;
            margin: 30px 0 15px;
        }

        .stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat( auto-fit, minmax(190px, 1fr) );
            gap: 18px;
        }

        .stat-card {
            display: block;
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 23px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        a.stat-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            border-color: #94a3b8;
        }

        .stat-label {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-bottom: 14px;
        }

        .stat-number {
            font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
            font-weight: bold;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }

        .stat-note {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--muted);
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .revenue {
            color: var(--success);
        }

        .management-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
        }

        .management-card {
            display: block;
            background: var(--white);
            padding: 22px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            color: var(--text);
            text-decoration: none;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            transition: transform 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
        }

        .management-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            border-color: #94a3b8;
        }

        .management-icon {
            font-size: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 13px;
        }

        .management-card h3 {
            margin: 0 0 8px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        .management-card p {
            color: var(--muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .footer {
            color: var(--muted);
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 760px) {
            .layout {
                display: block;
            }

            .sidebar {
                width: 100%;
                padding: 18px;
            }

            .sidebar-subtitle {
                margin-bottom: 15px;
            }

            .nav-label {
                margin-top: 15px;
            }

            .sidebar nav {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
                gap: 4px;
            }

            .sidebar a {
                margin: 0;
            }

            .topbar {
                padding: 18px;
                align-items: flex-start;
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .admin-info {
                text-align: left;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 20px 16px;
            }
        }





.inventory-panel {
    background: var(--white);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    overflow: hidden;
}

.inventory-heading {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 20px 22px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.inventory-heading h3 {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 16px;
}

.inventory-heading p,
.inventory-empty p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
}

.inventory-heading a {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.inventory-heading a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
}

.inventory-table-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    overflow-x: auto;
}

.inventory-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-size: 13px;
    text-align: left;
}

.inventory-table th,
.inventory-table td {
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.inventory-table th {
    background: #f8fafc;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 600;
}

.inventory-table tbody tr:last-child td {
    border-bottom: none;
}

.inventory-table small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 4px;
    color: var(--muted);
}

.stock-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 5px 9px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.stock-low {
    background: #fef3c7;
    color: #92400e;
}

.stock-out {
    background: #fee2e2;
    color: #991b1b;
}

.inventory-empty {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    padding: 24px;
}

.inventory-empty > span {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #dcfce7;
    color: #166534;
    font-size: 20px;
}

.inventory-empty strong {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
}

@media (max-width: 500px) {
    .inventory-heading {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .inventory-table th,
    .inventory-table td {
        padding: 12px;
    }
}

/* Additional mobile responsiveness improvements */

.sidebar nav .nav-label {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
}

.sidebar a {
    min-height: 44px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
}

.inventory-table-wrap {
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
}

@media (max-width: 760px) {
    .sidebar {
        padding: 18px 14px;
    }

    .sidebar nav {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        align-items: stretch;
    }

    .topbar {
        gap: 10px;
    }

    .welcome h2 {
        font-size: 22px;
    }

    .stats,
    .management-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 12px;
    }

    .stat-card,
    .management-card {
        padding: 16px;
        min-width: 0;
    }

    .stat-number {
        font-size: 25px;
    }
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
    .sidebar nav {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .stats,
    .management-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .topbar {
        padding: 16px;
    }

    .content {
        padding: 18px 12px;
    }

    .inventory-heading {
        padding: 16px;
    }

    .inventory-empty {
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: 18px;
    }

    .section-title {
        margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .footer {
        padding: 20px 12px;
    }
}

        .admin-mobile-toggle {
            display: none;
        }

        .admin-nav-backdrop {
            display: none;
        }

        @media (max-width: 760px) {
            .sidebar {
                position: fixed;
                top: 0;
                left: 0;
                bottom: 0;
                width: 280px;
                max-width: 85vw;
                box-sizing: border-box;
                z-index: 1001;
                overflow-y: auto;
                transform: translateX(-105%);
                transition: transform 0.25s ease;
                box-shadow: 8px 0 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
            }

            .sidebar.admin-sidebar-open {
                transform: translateX(0);
            }

            .admin-mobile-toggle {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                width: 42px;
                height: 42px;
                background: #263449;
                color: white;
                border: 1px solid #4b5563;
                border-radius: 8px;
                font-size: 22px;
                cursor: pointer;
            }

            .sidebar nav {
                display: block;
            }

            .admin-nav-backdrop.admin-backdrop-open {
                display: block;
                position: fixed;
                inset: 0;
                background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.55);
                z-index: 1000;
            }

            .topbar {
                flex-direction: row;
                align-items: center;
                padding: 16px;
            }

            .topbar-heading {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 12px;
            }

            body.admin-menu-open {
                overflow: hidden;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="layout">

    <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="brand">CapCentral</div>
        <div class="sidebar-subtitle">Store administration</div>
<nav id="admin-sidebar-nav">
            <div class="nav-label">Main</div>

            <a href="/admin" class="active">Dashboard</a>
            <a href="/admin/orders">Orders</a>
            <a href="/admin/payments">Payments</a>
            <a href="/admin/deliveries">Deliveries</a>
            <a href="/admin/order-requests">Order Requests</a>

            <div class="nav-label">Management</div>




            <a href="/admin/products">Products & Stock</a>
            <a href="/admin/categories"> Categories</a>
            <a href="/admin/customers">Customers</a>
            <a href="/admin/services">Cap Services</a>

        </nav>
    </aside>

    <div class="admin-nav-backdrop" id="admin-nav-backdrop"></div>
    <main class="main">
        <header class="topbar">
            <div class="topbar-heading">
                <button type="button" class="admin-mobile-toggle"
                        id="admin-mobile-toggle"
                        aria-expanded="false"
                        aria-controls="admin-sidebar-nav"
                        aria-label="Open navigation">
                    ☰
                </button>
                <h1>Admin Dashboard</h1>
            </div>

            <div class="admin-info">
                Signed in as<br>
                <strong><%= admin.username %></strong>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="content">
            <section class="welcome">
                <h2>Welcome back, <%= admin.username %></h2>
                <p>
                    Monitor your store, review payments, manage stock,
                    and track customer orders.
                </p>
            </section>

            <h2 class="section-title">Business overview</h2>

            <section class="stats">
                <article class="stat-card">
                    <div class="stat-label">Customers</div>
                    <div class="stat-number">
                        <%= Number(stats.customers).toLocaleString() %>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-note">Registered accounts counted by the current controller</div>
                </article>

                <a class="stat-card" href="/admin/orders" aria-label="Open Total Orders records">
                    <div class="stat-label">Total Orders</div>
                    <div class="stat-number">
                        <%= Number(stats.orders).toLocaleString() %>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-note">Orders recorded in the database</div>
                </a>

                <a class="stat-card" href="/admin/payments" aria-label="Open Successful Payments records">
                    <div class="stat-label">Successful Payments</div>
                    <div class="stat-number">
                        <%= Number(stats.payments).toLocaleString() %>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-note">Payments marked successful in the database</div>
                </a>

                <a class="stat-card" href="/admin/services" aria-label="Open Cap Services records">
                    <div class="stat-label">Cap Services</div>
                    <div class="stat-number">
                        <%= Number(stats.services).toLocaleString() %>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-note">Click to view service records</div>
                </a>

                <a class="stat-card" href="/admin/revenue" aria-label="Open Recorded Revenue records">
                    <div class="stat-label">Recorded Revenue</div>
                    <div class="stat-number revenue">
                        ₦<%= Number(stats.revenue).toLocaleString('en-NG', {
                            minimumFractionDigits: 2,
                            maximumFractionDigits: 2
                        }) %>
                    </div>
                    <div class="stat-note">Based on payments currently marked successful</div>
                </a>
            </section>


<h2 class="section-title">Inventory alerts</h2>

<section class="inventory-panel">
    <div class="inventory-heading">
        <div>
            <h3>Low stock & unavailable caps</h3>
            <p>Products that may need restocking.</p>
        </div>

        <a href="/admin/products">Manage products →</a>
    </div>

    <% if (!lowStockProducts || lowStockProducts.length === 0) { %>
        <div class="inventory-empty">
            <span>✓</span>
            <div>
                <strong>No stock alerts</strong>
                <p>No active products currently match the alert rules.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    <% } else { %>
        <div class="inventory-table-wrap">
            <table class="inventory-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Product</th>
                        <th>Category</th>
                        <th>Stock</th>
                        <th>Price</th>
                        <th>Status</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <% lowStockProducts.forEach(product => { %>
                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                <strong><%= product.name %></strong>
                                <small><%= product.product_code %></small>
                            </td>
                            <td><%= product.category %></td>
                            <td><%= Number(product.stock_quantity) %></td>
                            <td>
                                ₦<%= Number(product.price).toLocaleString('en-NG', {
                                    minimumFractionDigits: 2,
                                    maximumFractionDigits: 2
                                }) %>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <% if (Number(product.stock_quantity) === 0) { %>
                                    <span class="stock-badge stock-out">Out of stock</span>
                                <% } else { %>
                                    <span class="stock-badge stock-low">Low stock</span>
                                <% } %>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    <% }) %>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    <% } %>
</section>



<h2 class="section-title">Recent Orders</h2>

<section class="inventory-panel">
    <div class="inventory-heading">
        <div>
            <h3>Latest 5 orders</h3>
            <p>Recently placed customer orders.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/admin/orders">View all orders →</a>
    </div>

    <% if (!recentOrders || recentOrders.length === 0) { %>
        <div class="inventory-empty">
            <span>✓</span>
            <div>
                <strong>No orders yet</strong>
                <p>New orders will appear here when customers place them.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    <% } else { %>
        <div class="inventory-table-wrap">
            <table class="inventory-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Order reference</th>
                        <th>Customer</th>
                        <th>Amount</th>
                        <th>Status</th>
                        <th>Date</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <% recentOrders.forEach(order => { %>
                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                <strong><%= order.order_reference || ('#' + order.id) %></strong>
                            </td>
                            <td><%= order.customer_name || 'N/A' %></td>
                            <td>
                                <%= order.currency || 'NGN' %>
                                <%= Number(order.total_amount || 0).toLocaleString('en-NG', {
                                    minimumFractionDigits: 2,
                                    maximumFractionDigits: 2
                                }) %>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <span class="stock-badge <%= String(order.order_status || '').toLowerCase() === 'completed' || String(order.order_status || '').toLowerCase() === 'delivered' ? 'stock-low' : 'stock-out' %>">
                                    <%= order.order_status || 'Pending' %>
                                </span>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <%= order.created_at ? new Date(order.created_at).toLocaleDateString('en-GB') : 'N/A' %>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    <% }) %>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    <% } %>
</section>



            <h2 class="section-title">Store management</h2>

            <section class="management-grid">
                <a class="management-card" href="/admin/orders">
                    <div class="management-icon">Orders</div>
                    <h3>Orders</h3>
                    <p>Review customer orders and manage order progress.</p>
                </a>

                <a class="management-card" href="/admin/order-requests">
                    <div class="management-icon">Requests</div>
                    <h3>Order Requests</h3>
                    <p>Review and approve or reject customer cancellation and refund requests.</p>
                </a>

                <a class="management-card" href="/admin/payments">
                    <div class="management-icon">Payments</div>
                    <h3>Payments</h3>
                    <p>Review payment records and transaction statuses.</p>
                </a>

                <a class="management-card" href="/admin/revenue">
                    <div class="management-icon">₦</div>
                    <h3>Recorded Revenue</h3>
                    <p>View successful transactions included in recorded revenue.</p>
                </a>

                <a class="management-card" href="/admin/deliveries">
                    <div class="management-icon">Deliveries</div>
                    <h3>Deliveries</h3>
                    <p>Track deliveries and update delivery progress.</p>
                </a>

                <a class="management-card" href="/admin/products">
                    <div class="management-icon">Products</div>
                    <h3>Products & Stock</h3>
                    <p>Manage product details, prices, and available quantities.</p>
                </a>




                <a class="management-card" href="/admin/categories">
                    <div class="management-icon">Categories</div>
                    <h3>Categories</h3>
                    <p>Add categories, manage their products, and control customer visibility.</p>
                </a>
                <a class="management-card" href="/admin/customers">
                    <div class="management-icon">Customers</div>
                    <h3>Customers</h3>
                    <p>Review customer accounts and contact information.</p>
                </a>

                <a class="management-card" href="/admin/services">
                    <div class="management-icon">Services</div>
                    <h3>Cap Services</h3>
                    <p>Review resizing and laundry service requests.</p>
                </a>
            </section>
        </div>

        <footer class="footer">
            CapCentral Administration<br>
            <span id="dashboard-refresh-status">Live dashboard refresh is enabled (every 15 seconds).</span>
        </footer>
    </main>

</div>
